    <!-- Editorial Title -->
    <mxCell id="hdr90" value="&lt;div style='width:696px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;white-space:normal;'&gt;&lt;div style='display:inline-block;background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;MINTED TEMPLATE T90 • SPLIT-WATERLINE 3D ICEBERG • IDEA #1 (MINT-13)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:37px;font-weight:900;color:#0F172A;letter-spacing:-0.9px;line-height:1.08;'&gt;Computer-Use Agents: &lt;span style='color:#2563EB;'&gt;The 95% Iceberg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#334155;margin-top:6px;'&gt;Why a 15-line browser-click demo breaks — and the &lt;b style='color:#0F172A;'&gt;S.I.G.H.T.&lt;/b&gt; guardrails that hit &lt;b style='color:#047857;'&gt;91.4%&lt;/b&gt; in prod&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34" y="20" width="700" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
